INT: What was your first impression when you landed in Camp Kilmer?

EM: Freedom.

INT: How did that feel?

EM: Wonderful. Wonderful. But I was worrying about my parents.

INT: Where were they?

EM: In-- back in Hungary.

INT: At any time, did they leave Hungary?

