INT: Where was your husband born?

EM: In Szeged. It's one of the biggest city after Budapest.

INT: What was his date of birth?

EM: [SIGHING] November 12, 1921.

INT: And where did he survive the war? Where did he survive the war?

EM: In Budapest, hiding different places. And he was lucky. He was never in the ghetto.

INT: And his late wife was in what concentration camp?

EM: Yeah.

